ed file, as in <code>Dynlink.loadfile</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-load\"><a href=\"#val-load\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> load : <span>bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Same as loadfile but try to load plugins dir if loadfile raise an Error</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <code>Errors.Error</code> <p>if the plugin failed to be loaded</p></li></ul></div></div>"}